505
00:47:50.697 --> 00:47:51.489
<I>I am self-taught.</I>

506
00:47:51.514 --> 00:47:53.988
<i>I always drawn pictures
ever since, I was a child.</i>

507
00:47:54.064 --> 00:47:56.059
<I>One of my guardians,
Barnabas,</I>

508
00:47:56.084 --> 00:47:57.791
