554
00:51:15.928 --> 00:51:17.839
Nia, it is I again,
until you give me,

555
00:51:17.864 --> 00:51:19.720
some text to
work, I am idle,

556
00:51:19.796 --> 00:51:21.398
and that does
not seem like...

557
00:51:21.423 --> 00:51:23.024
