734
01:05:03.409 --> 01:05:04.909
We are going to
live every day.

735
01:05:04.933 --> 01:05:06.505
To remember
as I feeling.

736
01:05:14.595 --> 01:05:17.068
We will not even
exist anymore.

737
01:05:26.416 --> 01:05:27.916
No.

738
